# P9 — Platform code consolidation

## North star (fit-aligned)

**web = operator only** · **portal = sole guest auth/registration** · **marketing + portal = shared guest bootstrap package**.

**Keep:** web `/catalog/*` **redirect shims** (307) — legacy URLs.  
**Remove:** web public-auth BFF · orphan flow · catalog layout bootstrap.

→ [p9-app-fit.md](p9-app-fit.md)

---

## Strict scores today

| Axis | Score |
| ---- | ----: |
| Guest bootstrap (M+P) | 3.0 |
| Surface boundary | 3.5 |
| Auth/BFF dedup | 2.0 |
| **Composite** | **3.2** |

**Exit (fit):** composite **≥ 8.7** · surface **≥ 9** · web zero public-auth routes.

---

## EPIC map (fit-aligned)

Local duplicates removed under M+P. **`session-client`** (P9-0-N-002) owns JWT decode/validate + cookie name constants for web · portal.

### P9-1-N-001 — delete web `public-auth` BFF

Removed `apps/web/app/api/public-auth/*` · trimmed `middleware.ts` `PUBLIC_BFF_API_PATHS`. Catalog redirect shims **kept** (`/catalog/*` → marketing/portal).

### P9-1-N-003 — remove web catalog layout bootstrap (G-SURF-03/05 · G-BOOT-08)

`apps/web/app/layout.tsx` always calls `resolveBootstrapAppSessionForHostAsync(host)` — no `isPublicCatalogPath` branch and no guest actor for `/catalog/*`.

**Deleted:**

- `apps/web/src/tenant/resolve-public-catalog-bootstrap.server.ts`
- `apps/web/src/auth/resolve-identity-bff-tenant.ts` (catalog-bootstrap tenant shim; operator BFF uses `identity-bff-headers.resolveOperatorBffTenantId`)
- `apps/web/test/resolve-public-catalog-bootstrap.spec.ts`

**Unchanged:** `apps/web/app/(public)/catalog/**` redirect pages · `middleware.ts` `/catalog` matcher.

### P9-0-N-006 — web multi-level host → tenant-kernel (G-BOOT-07)

Deleted `apps/web/src/tenant/resolve-multi-level-host.ts`. Web tenant modules call `parseMultiLevelTenantHost` from `@app-tour/tenant-kernel` with env from `platform-host-env.ts`. Operator-only helpers (`isOperatorAdminHost`, `resolveClubSubdomainFromHost`) live in `operator-admin-host.ts`.

### P9-1-N-004 — portal-only catalog session + headers (G-AUTH-04/05/06)

Guest catalog auth modules live **only** under `apps/portal`:

- `read-public-catalog-session.server.ts`
- `build-catalog-registration-headers.server.ts`
- `public-auth-bff-error.ts`

**Deleted from web:** the three modules above · orphan `submit-denali-registration.server.ts` · `submit-urban-registration.server.ts` · `build-catalog-registration-headers.spec.ts`.

### P9-2-N-001 — API-only pluginId (G-BOOT-03)

`resolveGuestSurfaceBootstrapForHost` in `guest-surface-host`:

- **Production:** `pluginId` only from `GET /public/tenant-context`
- **Dev:** `resolveDevPluginIdForTenantId(tenantId)` — smoke UUID map; **no** `hostname.includes`

M+P `resolve-*-bootstrap.ts` are thin wrappers (~15 lines each).

### P9-0-N-002 — `session-client` (web + portal)

Package `packages/session-client` owns:

- `decodeJwtPayload` · `isJwtExpired` · `validateSessionToken`
- `SESSION_COOKIE_NAMES` (`atour_op_session` · `atour_mb_session`)
- `resolveSessionCookieSecure` · `setSessionCookieOnResponse` (plain `Headers`, no Next import)

Apps keep thin `build-session-cookie.ts` shims that bind surface cookie name.

### P9-0-N-001 — `guest-surface-host` (M+P)

Package `packages/guest-surface-host` owns:

- `PHASE_43_HOST_TENANT_IDS` · `resolveTenantIdFromDevHost(surface)`
- `resolveTenantIdFromIngressLabel` · `resolvePublicBrandingHost`
- `fetchPublicTenantContextForHost(host, { apiBaseUrl, onBeforeFetch })`
- `isDevGuestHostAllowed` (alias `isDevWebSessionAllowed` in apps)

**Consumers:** `apps/marketing` · `apps/portal` only. **Web must not import.**

Local duplicates removed: `resolve-host-tenant.ts` · `fetch-public-tenant-context.ts` · `resolve-public-branding-host.ts` under M+P.

### P9-0 — Shared packages

| Nano | Deliverable | Consumers |
| ---- | ----------- | --------- |
| P9-0-N-001 | `guest-surface-host` — M+P bootstrap only | marketing · portal |
| P9-0-N-002 | `session-client` — JWT helpers | **web · portal** (not marketing) |
| P9-0-N-003 | `isDevGuestHostAllowed` — **M+P only** | marketing · portal |
| P9-0-N-006 | web → tenant-kernel for multi-level host | web |

**Removed from P9-0:** cross-app BFF factory (portal-only inline) · catalog headers in guest pkg (portal-only).

### P9-1 — Web guest cleanup (not full catalog removal)

| Nano | Deliverable |
| ---- | ----------- |
| P9-1-N-001 | Delete web `app/api/public-auth/*` |
| P9-1-N-002 | Delete orphan registration flow |
| P9-1-N-003 | Remove catalog **bootstrap** from layout — operator `resolveBootstrapAppSessionForHostAsync` only; `/catalog/*` redirect pages unchanged |
| P9-1-N-004 | Portal-only catalog session + headers + bff-error |

### P9-2 — API-only pluginId (M+P)

| Nano | Deliverable |
| ---- | ----------- |
| P9-2-N-001 | Remove hostname pluginId heuristic |

### P9-3-N-001 — `guard:p9-surface-boundary`

Script `scripts/guards/guard-p9-surface-boundary.mjs` enforces `p9-package-boundary.yaml` rules:

- **P9-SURF-01** — no `apps/web/app/api/public-auth` routes
- **P9-SURF-02** — no local `PHASE_43_HOST_TENANT_IDS` in M+P
- **P9-SURF-03** — web must not import `guest-surface-host`
- **P9-PKG-01** — `guest-surface-host` must not import `apps/*`

Wired into `pnpm run p9:gate` after P9-0 wiring checks.

### P9-3-N-002 — `public-catalog.md` portal-only (G-SURF-06)

`docs/workspaces/denali/public-catalog.md` documents M17 OTP on **`apps/portal`** only; web `/catalog/*` redirect shims and operator `/api/auth/*` called out separately. SMK-DREG-01 superseded by portal `SMK-PTL-01`.

### P9-3-N-003 — portal-only registration E2E (G-SURF-07)

Removed `apps/web/tests/e2e/denali-catalog-registration.spec.ts` · `playwright.denali.config.ts`. Registration smokes: `apps/portal/tests/e2e/portal-*-smoke.spec.ts` via `pnpm --filter @apps/portal run test:smoke`.

### P9-3 — Boundary gate

| Nano | Deliverable |
| ---- | ----------- |
| P9-3-N-001 | `guard:p9-surface-boundary` |
| P9-3-N-002 | doc sync portal-only |
| P9-3-N-003 | e2e portal-only |
| P9-3-N-005 | `p9:gate` |

**Moved out:** P9-3-N-004 tenant_domains → **P10** G-ING-04b.

